<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja" class="h-full">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>404 Page Not Found · Wayup</title>
    <!-- Import Google Fonts (Outfit & Inter) -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&family=Outfit:wght@700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN for consistent and styling independence -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
      tailwind.config = {
        theme: {
          extend: {
            fontFamily: {
              sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
              outfit: ['Outfit', 'sans-serif'],
            }
          }
        }
      }
    </script>
    <style>
      /* Smooth transitions for interactive elements */
      .transition-all {
        transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class="h-full bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 font-sans flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden relative selection:bg-orange-500 selection:text-white">
    <!-- Background glowing decorative circles -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-orange-600/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none animate-pulse"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 2s;"></div>

    <div class="max-w-md w-full px-6 text-center z-10">
      <!-- 404 energetic typography -->
      <h1 class="text-[120px] font-extrabold font-outfit leading-none tracking-tighter bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 via-rose-500 to-cyan-500 drop-shadow-[0_10px_10px_rgba(249,115,22,0.15)]">
        404
      </h1>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-outfit">
        ページが見つかりません
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        お探しのページは存在しないか、現在準備中です。<br />
        URLが正しいかご確認ください。
      </p>

      <p class="mt-1 text-slate-500 text-xs font-mono">
        The requested page does not exist or is under construction.
      </p>

      <!-- Action Button -->
      <div class="mt-8">
        <%!-- Use DiaryWeb.Endpoint.url() to generate the absolute main domain URL dynamically --%>
        <a href={DiaryWeb.Endpoint.url()} class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 to-rose-400 hover:from-orange-300 hover:to-rose-300 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/20 hover:shadow-orange-500/35 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-slate-950 focus:ring-orange-400">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
          </svg>
          トップページへ戻る
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer / Logo placeholder -->
      <div class="mt-16 flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 opacity-40 hover:opacity-60 transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-xs tracking-widest font-outfit font-bold uppercase text-slate-400">Wayup</span>
        <span class="text-slate-600">•</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono">Workout & Activity Diary</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
